# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to transpile a [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") to a standard [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). It continues with the same time evolution example from the [fermionic circuits guide](circuit#fermionic-circuit-explanation).\n"
msgstr "Ipinapaliwanag ng gabay na ito kung paano i-transpile ang isang [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") sa karaniwang [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). Ipinagpapatuloy nito ang parehong halimbawa ng time evolution mula sa [gabay sa fermionic circuit](circuit#fermionic-circuit-explanation).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation stages {#transpilation-stages}"
msgstr "Mga stage ng transpilation {#transpilation-stages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As explained in [`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\"), the preset pass managers in this project split the transpilation into the following stages:\n"
msgstr "Gaya ng ipinaliwanag sa [`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\"), hinahati ng mga preset pass manager sa proyektong ito ang transpilation sa mga sumusunod na stage:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Input** {#input}"
msgstr "**Pasok** {#input}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the input circuit to a directed acyclic graph (DAG) data structure.\n"
msgstr "Kino-convert ang input circuit sa isang directed acyclic graph (DAG) na data structure.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Optimization** {#optimization}"
msgstr "**Pag-optimize** {#optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keeps the circuit in fermionic space. These passes use fermionic structure and commutation relations while problem-aware knowledge remains fully available. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") is the pass that Trotterizes an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate here, with a product formula or with [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\"), and [`QDriftTrotterization`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-q-drift-trotterization#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization\") its occupation-aware variant; see [Optimization Passes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes#qiskit-fermions-transpiler-passes-optimization) for the full set and [Synthesize an Evolution gate in fermionic space](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation) for how a product formula is chosen.\n"
msgstr "Pinananatili ang circuit sa fermionic space. Ginagamit ng mga pass na ito ang fermionic structure at mga commutation relation habang ganap pang magagamit ang kaalamang may kinalaman sa problema. Ang [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") ang pass na nagte-Trotterize ng isang [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate dito, gamit ang product formula o ang [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\"), at ang [`QDriftTrotterization`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-q-drift-trotterization#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization\") ang occupation-aware na variant nito; tingnan ang [Optimization Passes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes#qiskit-fermions-transpiler-passes-optimization) para sa buong set at ang [Mag-synthesize ng Evolution gate sa fermionic space](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation) para sa kung paano pinipili ang product formula.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Layout** {#layout}"
msgstr "**Pagkakaayos** {#layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maps fermionic mode registers to quantum registers. For occupation-basis mappings like Jordan-Wigner, each fermionic mode maps to a single qubit. This stage also supports more general mappings where the number of qubits differs from the number of fermionic modes.\n"
msgstr "Minamapa ang mga fermionic mode register sa mga quantum register. Para sa mga occupation-basis mapping tulad ng Jordan-Wigner, ang bawat fermionic mode ay minamapa sa iisang qubit. Sinusuportahan din ng stage na ito ang mas pangkalahatang mapping kung saan iba ang bilang ng mga qubit sa bilang ng mga fermionic mode.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Synthesis** {#synthesis}"
msgstr "**Sintesis** {#synthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts fermionic gates to qubit operations by using the chosen fermion-to-qubit mapping. [`FermionicGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-gate#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate\") instances are transformed into sequences of standard quantum gates. A barrier is carried through onto every qubit of each register it touched, so it continues to separate the gates on either side of it during the qubit stage.\n"
msgstr "Kino-convert ang mga fermionic gate sa mga qubit operation gamit ang napiling fermion-to-qubit mapping. Ang mga instance ng [`FermionicGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-gate#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate\") ay ginagawang mga sequence ng karaniwang quantum gate. Ang isang barrier ay dinadala sa bawat qubit ng bawat register na hinawakan nito, kaya patuloy nitong pinaghihiwalay ang mga gate sa magkabilang panig nito sa qubit stage.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qubit** {#qubit}"
msgstr "**Qubit** {#qubit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiles the resulting qubit circuit by using standard Qiskit methods, including optimization, layout, and routing for your target hardware.\n"
msgstr "Tina-transpile ang resultang qubit circuit gamit ang mga karaniwang paraan ng Qiskit, kasama ang optimization, layout, at routing para sa target mong hardware.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Output** {#output}"
msgstr "**Resulta** {#output}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the internal DAG data structure to the desired output format.\n"
msgstr "Kino-convert ang internal na DAG data structure sa nais na output format.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "A practical example: transpilation using Jordan-Wigner {#a-practical-example-transpilation-using-jordan-wigner}"
msgstr "Isang praktikal na halimbawa: transpilation gamit ang Jordan-Wigner {#a-practical-example-transpilation-using-jordan-wigner}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the preset pass manager to transpile your fermionic circuit with the Jordan-Wigner fermion-to-qubit mapping:\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang preset pass manager para i-transpile ang iyong fermionic circuit gamit ang Jordan-Wigner fermion-to-qubit mapping:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.circuit import FermionicCircuit\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.circuit.library import Evolution\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.operators import FermionOperator, cre, ann\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets import generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Create the same fermionic circuit from the previous guide\n"
"    >>> circuit = FermionicCircuit(4)\n"
"    >>> hamiltonian = FermionOperator.from_terms([\n"
"    ...     ([cre(0), ann(2)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(2), ann(0)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(1), ann(3)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(3), ann(1)], 0.5),\n"
"    ... ])\n"
"    >>> hamiltonian.groups = [0, 0, 1, 1]\n"
"    >>> evolution = Evolution(4, hamiltonian, time=1.0)\n"
"    >>> circuit.append(evolution, circuit.register)\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Generate the Jordan-Wigner transpilation pipeline\n"
"    >>> pm = generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Transpile the fermionic circuit to a qubit circuit\n"
"    >>> qubit_circuit = pm.run(circuit)\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # The result is a standard QuantumCircuit\n"
"    >>> print(type(qubit_circuit))\n"
"    <class 'qiskit.circuit.quantumcircuit.QuantumCircuit'>\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

